Continuing the CI loop. Run 9 (69308f0) failed with C2695 calling convention errors only in build-bridge32: IASIO methods in asio.h lack STDMETHODCALLTYPE. Fix: add STDMETHODCALLTYPE to all 19 virtual methods in IASIO in asio.h. Then commit, push, dispatch, poll.

I read asio.h this session and edited it (unknwn include + uuid). The IASIO block content is known from my read:

```
// Interfaz COM del driver (mismos orden de métodos que el SDK oficial)
struct __declspec(uuid("B7A9E3D1-2C45-4F0A-8D63-1E5A0B7C9F42")) IASIO : public IUnknown {
    virtual ASIOBool init(void* sysHandle) = 0;
    virtual void getDriverName(char* name) = 0;
    virtual long getDriverVersion() = 0;
    virtual void getErrorMessage(char* error) = 0;
    virtual ASIOError start() = 0;
    virtual ASIOError stop() = 0;
    virtual ASIOError getChannels(long* numInputChannels, long* numOutputChannels) = 0;
